      ],
      "text": "Calcified parenchymal nodule (Ghon focus) ± ipsilateral hilar node (Ranke complex)"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " → healed primary TB"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
